webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0690562Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0793804Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0803518Z ^[[0m
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0804231Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0804984Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0805280Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0805595Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0806961Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0807366Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0807599Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0808133Z    if you are ready to continue.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0808379Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0808884Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0809620Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0810477Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0810989Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0811213Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0811426Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0811772Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0812022Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0812538Z    can use Nix.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0812730Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0812869Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0813070Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0813449Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0814031Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0816001Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0816977Z I will:
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0817258Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0817590Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0818136Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0818618Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0819066Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0819386Z  - install Nix in /nix
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0819693Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0820583Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0821065Z    /root
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0832820Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0833845Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0844678Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0845472Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0845804Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0846612Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0847240Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0864867Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0865595Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0875658Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0876405Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
