webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0878191Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0878865Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0879227Z 
webui PHPUnit	Install Nix	2026-10-08T16:59:18.0879381Z If you would like to
